- Language filters
- Novel status filters
- Sorting options supported by the existing application
- Pagination or load-more functionality, consistent with the existing implementation

Clicking a novel card or title must open its individual detail page.

All listing content must come from Sanity. Do not hardcode sample novels into production components.

## 5. Individual Novel Detail Page

Create a complete, reusable detail-page layout.

Display sections in the following order when the corresponding content exists:

### Section 1: Breadcrumbs
Home → Novels → Category → Novel Title

### Section 2: Novel Hero
